1. Backport of TanStack/ai#1375 (issue #1374): the run's abort signal
   reaches every Gemini request. Remove with @tanstack/ai-gemini >= 0.29.4
   (it needs @tanstack/ai ^0.55.0).
2. SAFETY-family finish reasons and a blocked prompt (promptFeedback with no
   candidate) finish as content_filter instead of stop or no terminal event.
   Upstream PR to be opened; remove when released.

